# Puppet Crafting: "{4}{G}: Return this card from your graveyard to your hand." Bot1 enchants its Ornithopter on turn 1 (a 5/5
# thopter Construct). On turn 2 Bot2's Disenchant destroys the Ornithopter; the Aura, enchanting nothing, is put into its owner's
# graveyard as a state-based action (CR 704.5m). On turn 3 all five Moxen pay {4}{G} and the card goes to Bot1's hand from the
# graveyard. The Moxen are all tapped afterwards.

